<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>常见问题 on Storack</title><link>https://www.storack.com/zh/resources/faq/</link><description>Recent content in 常见问题 on Storack</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 01 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://www.storack.com/zh/resources/faq/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>产品使用什么材料？</title><link>https://www.storack.com/zh/resources/faq/hdpe-material/</link><pubDate>Wed, 01 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.storack.com/zh/resources/faq/hdpe-material/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;当前产品系列均采用 HDPE 注塑成型。具体材料牌号，以及低温、卫生或再生料含量等特殊要求，需要按订单确认。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>可以定制颜色和 Logo 吗？</title><link>https://www.storack.com/zh/resources/faq/custom-colors-logo/</link><pubDate>Wed, 01 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.storack.com/zh/resources/faq/custom-colors-logo/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;可以。支持沟通定制颜色、模压 Logo、印字和识别标记；起订量与颜色容差会在报价时确认。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>批量采购前可以测试样品吗？</title><link>https://www.storack.com/zh/resources/faq/sample-before-order/</link><pubDate>Wed, 01 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.storack.com/zh/resources/faq/sample-before-order/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;可以。立体库项目强烈建议进行样品确认。请提供设备接口图和测试条件，使样品验证能够代表最终应用。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>如何确认货架载荷？</title><link>https://www.storack.com/zh/resources/faq/how-confirm-rack-load/</link><pubDate>Wed, 01 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.storack.com/zh/resources/faq/how-confirm-rack-load/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;货架载荷需要结合具体型号、支撑跨度、温度、存放时间、载荷分布和钢管布局确认。立体库项目建议在量产前确认图纸并进行代表性样品测试。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>四类托盘都可以加钢管吗？</title><link>https://www.storack.com/zh/resources/faq/can-add-steel-tubes/</link><pubDate>Wed, 01 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.storack.com/zh/resources/faq/can-add-steel-tubes/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;可以。网格川字、平板川字、平板川字加强型和网格田字均可配置钢管；具体数量和位置取决于所选模具。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>询价时需要提供哪些信息？</title><link>https://www.storack.com/zh/resources/faq/what-send-for-quote/</link><pubDate>Wed, 01 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.storack.com/zh/resources/faq/what-send-for-quote/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;请提供托盘尺寸、单元载荷及分布、货架或设备支撑方式、进叉方向、工作温度、采购数量、颜色和标记要求。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>